:synohw_badges_plug:
> Adds a small badge with the unit and bay ("DS 1", "DX 8") after each disk's device name on Unraid's Main page. Visual only: a script on the Main page (loaded through a `Menu="Buttons"` page, the hook Unraid's own Community Applications helper uses) asks this plugin which bay each sdX is in (`include/bays.php`, read-only) and adds the badges. Nothing in Unraid's configuration is written; if the Main page looks different from what the script expects, it adds nothing. Apply saves the key only (no daemon restart); reload the Main page.
:end

